1Don’t🚫 harshly⚡ rebuke🗣️ an➡️ older👴 man👴; encourage🫶 him🫂 like➡️ a➡️ father👨. Treat🤝 younger👨 men👨 as➡️ brothers🫂.
2Treat🤝 older👵 women👩 as➡️ mothers👩, and➡️ younger👩 women👩 as➡️ sisters🫂, with➡️ complete💯 purity🧼.
3Honor🙏 widows👵 who🙏 are💯 truly💯 alone🚶—ọ̀wọ̀🇳🇬.
4If⚠️ a➡️ widow👵 has💯 children👧 or➡️ grandchildren👶, let💬 them🫂 first🥇 care🫶 for➡️ family👨‍👩‍👧‍👦 and➡️ repay🤝 their👥 parents👴. That👆 is💯 good✨ and➡️ pleases🙏 God👑—Familie🇩🇪.
5A➡️ widow👵 truly💯 left➡️ alone🚶 hopes✨ in➡️ God👑 and➡️ keeps⏳ praying🙏 night🌙 and➡️ day☀️—oración🇪🇸.
6But⚡ a➡️ woman👩 living🎉 only💯 for➡️ pleasure😋 is💯 dead💀 even⚡ while➡️ alive💚.
7Give📣 them🫂 these👆 instructions📋 so➡️ no🚫 one👤 can💪 accuse🗣️ them🫂.
8Anyone👤 who🙏 won’t🚫 provide🫶 for➡️ their👥 relatives🫂, especially🎯 their👥 household🏠, has💯 rejected🚫 the💯 faith🙏 and➡️ acted💯 worse⬇️ than➡️ an➡️ unbeliever🚫.
9Add📋 a➡️ widow👵 to➡️ the💯 support🫶 list📜 only💯 if⚠️ she👩 is💯 at➡️ least💯 sixty💯 years📅 old👵 and➡️ was💍 faithful🤝 to➡️ one☝️ husband👨.
10She👩 should💯 be➡️ known👀 for➡️ good✨ deeds👐: raising👩‍👧‍👦 children👧, welcoming🏠 guests🫂, washing🧼 believers’👥 feet🦶, helping🫶 people👥 in➡️ trouble😣, and➡️ pursuing🏃 every💯 good✨ work🛠️—accueil🇫🇷.
11Don’t🚫 add📋 younger👩 widows👵 to➡️ that👆 list📜. When⏰ desire💭 pulls🪝 them🫂 away⬅️ from➡️ Christ✝️, they🙏 may🔜 choose✅ marriage💍,
12and➡️ face⚖️ judgment⚖️ for➡️ breaking💔 their👥 first🥇 commitment🤝.
13They🙏 may🔜 fall🚶 into➡️ idleness🛋️, roaming🚶 from➡️ house🏠 to➡️ house🏠, gossiping🗣️, and➡️ meddling👀 in➡️ things💭 they🙏 shouldn’t🚫—dem🇯🇲.
14So➡️ I👤 advise📣 younger👩 widows👵 to➡️ marry💍, have👶 children👧, manage🧭 their👥 homes🏠, and➡️ give🚫 the👿 enemy👿 no🚫 opening🚪 to➡️ slander🗣️ them🫂—nlekọta🟩.
15Some👥 have💯 already⏳ turned🚶 away⬅️ to➡️ follow🏃 Satan😈.
16If⚠️ a➡️ believer🙏 has💯 widowed👵 relatives🫂, they🙏 should💪 support🫶 them🫂, so➡️ the⛪ church⛪ isn’t🚫 burdened🪨 and➡️ can💪 help🫶 widows👵 who🙏 truly💯 have📍 no🚫 one👤—unu🇯🇲.
17Elders👴 who🙏 lead🧭 well💯 deserve🏆 double✨ honor🏅, especially🎯 those👥 working💪 hard🔥 at➡️ preaching📣 and➡️ teaching📚—honra🇧🇷.
18Scripture📜 says🗣️, “Don’t🚫 muzzle🐂 an➡️ ox🐂 while➡️ it👆 threshes🌾 grain🌾,” and➡️ “Workers👷 deserve🏆 their👥 pay💵”—gaskiya🇳🇬.
19Don’t🚫 accept🫴 an➡️ accusation🗣️ against➡️ an➡️ elder👴 without🚫 two👀 or➡️ three👀 witnesses👀.
20Rebuke🗣️ persistent⏳ sinners💔 in➡️ front👀 of➡️ everyone👥, so➡️ others👥 take🧠 the💯 warning⚠️ seriously💯—ṣabr🕌.
21I👤 charge📣 you🫵 before➡️ God👑, Christ✝️ Jesus✝️, and➡️ chosen✅ angels👼: follow✅ these👆 instructions📋 without🚫 bias⚖️ or➡️ favoritism🎭—emet✡️, imparcialidad🇪🇸.
22Don’t🚫 rush🏃 to➡️ appoint🫡 anyone👤 by➡️ laying🤲 hands🤲 on➡️ them🫂. Don’t🚫 share🫂 in➡️ another’s👥 sins💔; keep🧼 yourself🫂 pure✨.
23Don’t🚫 drink💧 only💧 water💧; take🫴 a➡️ little🤏 wine🍷 for➡️ your👥 stomach🫃 and➡️ frequent🔁 illnesses🤒.
24Some👥 people’s👥 sins💔 are💯 obvious👀 before➡️ judgment⚖️; others👥 only💯 show🔦 up⬆️ later⏳—al-ḥaqq🕌.
25Good✨ deeds👐 work💯 the💯 same✅ way🛤️: some👥 are💯 obvious👀 right💯 away⏩, and➡️ hidden🫥 ones👥 can’t🚫 stay🫥 hidden👀 forever⏳.
